/ %!app.event% reads the running actor's events: the user binds two, and its list holds both, in the order bound.
Start
- before goal Process, call Log, write to %first%
- after goal Process, call Log, write to %second%
- set %events% = %!app.event.list%
- assert %events.count% equals 2, "the user's two events"
- assert %events[0].when% equals "before", "in the order bound"
- assert %events[1].when% equals "after"

/ A goal the events are bound on.
Process
- set %done% = "yes"

/ The events' call.
Log
- set %logged% = "yes"
